---
description: Never credit Cursor, Claude, or any other agent on commits
alwaysApply: true
---

# No agent co-authors

Commits belong to the user only.

- Never add a `Co-authored-by` or `Co-Authored-By` trailer.
- Never credit Cursor, Claude, or any other agent in a commit message, PR body, or author field.
- Do not set the commit author or committer to an agent email such as `cursoragent@cursor.com` or `noreply@anthropic.com`.
- After every commit, read `git log -1`. If a trailer was added automatically, strip it before the commit is pushed.
